  skillDescription: "<color=#FFD700>Base (1★):</color> Gains 3% ATK per enemy in range (up to 5 stacks) and deals AoE Arts damage.\n<color=#FFD700>1st upgrade (2★):</color> adds two tiles beside the furthest tile of his range.\n<color=#FFD700>2nd upgrade (3★):</color> each Arts AoE hit deals damage twice."
